  </data>
  <data name="Welcome.Fly3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>3. Tune the frequency shown under Talking to, then call ATC: hold push-to-talk and speak, or use the buttons here or in the in-sim panel.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Welcome.Fly4" xml:space="preserve">
